# The felhunter for Alliance warlocks: Seeking Strahad (1798, from Gakin the
# Darkbinder in Stormwind or Lago Blackwrench in Ironforge) to Strahad Farsan
# in Ratchet, Tome of the Cabal (1758 to Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge; 1802,
# the Moldy Tome on the Hillsbrad shore and the Tattered Manuscript in a
# Thousand Needles cave; 1804, three Rods of Channeling from the Wetlands
# Dragonmaw casters) and The Binding (1795) at Strahad's circle in Ratchet.
# Drops: the rods from Dragonmaw Bonewarders (27) and Shadowwarders (28) at
# 80% (items.json); the raiders and other Dragonmaw drop none. The tome and
# the chest give their item every time. The Binding pays a Box of Souls.
# The fight: the Summoned Felhunter is level 30 and not elite; it appears only
# when the Tome of the Cabal is read at the circle, after Strahad and his
# acolytes finish drawing it. Lost fight: abandon The Binding and take it again
# from Strahad (quest notes, player reports).
# The Alliance leveling routes leave the chain out (see
# forever/alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills): it crosses between Ratchet,
# Ironforge, the Hillsbrad coast, Thousand Needles and the Wetlands.
# ASSUMED: The chain runs as in Classic above 30 (Classic flow; Forever's data has no play reports past the level-30 beta cap). In-game check: the cave chest, the murloc camp and Strahad's circle event.
# Sources: Forever's quest data (quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json,
# items.json) for the givers, the tome, the chest, the rods and the circle;
# the quest notes (data/local/mechanics) for the murloc camp, the cave path,
# the casters and the circle event; the reference class guides for the order.

step Seeking Strahad (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 30 Gakin the Darkbinder, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 30
  accept 1798 npc 6122                -- Gakin the Darkbinder

step Seeking Strahad (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 30 Lago Blackwrench, in the Forlorn Cavern, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 30
  accept 1798 npc 6120                -- Lago Blackwrench

step Strahad Farsan
  zone The Barrens
  tip Ratchet is a neutral goblin port on the Barrens coast: the boat from Booty Bay docks there. Strahad Farsan stands on the hill above the town, behind the engineers' hut, by his little tower; Menara Voidrender and two acolytes are with him. He sends you to Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge.
  turnin 1798                         -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 1758

step Krom Stoutarm
  zone Ironforge
  tip Krom Stoutarm is in the library of the Hall of Explorers. He wants two lost pieces of the Tome of the Cabal: one on the Hillsbrad coast, one in Thousand Needles.
  turnin 1758                         -- Krom Stoutarm
  accept 1802

step Moldy Tome
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The tome is a small grey-blue book lying in the sand of a murloc camp on the shore south-west of Southshore, near the water's edge. Six or seven murlocs guard it and more lurk underwater: they come in groups, so Fear one and keep your voidwalker on the rest. Walk down to the water to click it; from the hillside the crates block the cursor.
  collect 6931 quest 1802.1           -- Moldy Tome, from the Tome of the Cabal on the sand

step Tattered Manuscript
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip The centaur cave opens in the cliffs north of Freewind Post, a Horde town: keep clear of its guards. Inside, keep right at each fork, cross the pool by the small waterfall, and open the small dark box against the wall beside a larger chest: the larger one is the wrong one. You can open it only while on the quest. The centaurs respawn behind you on the way out.
  collect 6997 quest 1802.2           -- Tattered Manuscript, in the Damaged Chest

step Back to Krom
  zone Ironforge
  tip Krom pieces the tome together and gives you the Reconstructed Tome: keep it, Strahad takes it with the rods.
  turnin 1802                         -- Krom Stoutarm
  accept 1804

step Rods of Channeling
  zone Wetlands
  tip The Dragonmaw hold Angerfang Encampment in the hills east of the road from Menethil Harbor to Dun Algaz. Only the casters drop the rods, four kills in five: the Bonewarders (level 27, with skeleton pets) and Shadowwarders (28). A steep path north of the central spirit healer leads up into the camp past most of the warriors.
  collect 6930 x3 quest 1804.1        -- Rods of Channeling, from the Dragonmaw casters

step The Binding
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Strahad in Ratchet. When you accept, he draws the summoning circle and his acolytes channel a greater circle over it: wait inside the tower until both are done. Then use the Tome of the Cabal on the circle. The felhunter (level 30, not elite) silences and eats mana, and it vanishes after two minutes: have your voidwalker out, open with your damage over time at once and let the voidwalker tank. If you die or it wins, abandon The Binding and take it again from Strahad. Keep the tome: Strahad takes it back.
  turnin 1804                         -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 1795
  use 6999 @62.6,35.3                 -- Tome of the Cabal, on the circle
  kill 6268 quest 1795.1              -- Summoned Felhunter
  turnin 1795                         -- Strahad Farsan: Summon Felhunter
